WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.900
The first time LYNX SHARE opens, it asks where you're coming from.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.900
Coming from BandLab or a phone app? Pick the first choice.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.200
You're in the Simple layout, with a starter beat on a Drums track.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:22.400
Press Play, or the space bar, to hear it.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:32.600
Click the squares of the Drum Machine to add or remove hits.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:38.200
Set the speed with the tempo.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.600
Play it again: your beat, your tempo.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:50.200
Next: add a loop or record your voice. This card shows how.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:57.400
The Loops panel opens. Drag any loop onto the timeline.
